<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) - Piet Mondrian &amp; De Stijl</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Single-file exhibition landing page on Piet Mondrian's Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930), the De Stijl movement, and Neoplasticism.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
